  <p id="c-liangshu-012-weirui-first:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-012-weirui-first:p001:m0000" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AA">韋叡</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-012-weirui-first:p001:m0004" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AA">懷文</persName>，京兆杜陵人也。自漢丞相<persName id="c-liangshu-012-weirui-first:p001:m0018" ref="vna_am7_jn5">賢</persName>以後，世爲三輔著姓。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-012-weirui-first:p001:m0030" ref="axs_5y7_p7w">玄</persName>，避吏隱於長安南山。宋武帝入關，以太尉掾徵，不至。伯父祖征，宋末爲光祿勳。父<persName id="c-liangshu-012-weirui-first:p001:m0069" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_A">祖歸</persName>，寧遠長史。</p>
</text>
